      "start_seconds": 254.81,
      "end_seconds": 284.26,
      "duration_seconds": 29.45,
      "text": "it's reasonable to be concerned but right now a gradual memory problem that needs further assessment is my leading thought not anything worse. A memory test is what I'd like next for memory loss. I'm going to order a brain scan for memory loss. Keep a daily routine and write things down a notebook by the door works well. Avoid taking any extra painkillers on top of what I'm prescribing without checking with us"
